---
// Tesla Official Global Footer
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="relative bg-black text-neutral-400 text-xs py-14 px-6 border-t border-white/10 select-none">
  <!-- Glowing Cybertruck LED lightbar divider -->
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto h-[2px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-red-600 to-transparent mb-12 opacity-80 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(232,33,39,0.5)]"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-6">
    <!-- Brand / Trademark -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-wider uppercase text-neutral-300">
      <span>Tesla © {currentYear}</span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span class="text-neutral-400">Austin, Texas, USA</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Legal & Navigation Links -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 font-medium text-neutral-400 text-[11px]">
      <a href="https://www.tesla.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">
        Privacy & Legal
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.tesla.com/vin-recall-search" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">
        Vehicle Recalls
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.tesla.com/contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">
        Contact
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.tesla.com/blog" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">
        News
      </a>
      <a href="#order" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">
        Get Updates
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.tesla.com/findus" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">
        Locations
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Disclaimer Note -->
    <p class="max-w-3xl text-center text-[10px] text-neutral-400 font-mono leading-relaxed mt-2">
      Certain high-data usage vehicle features require at least Standard Connectivity, including maps, navigation and voice commands. Features that require Cellular data and third-party licenses are subject to change. Some vehicle options shown may require additional purchase.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

